37 {{BIBLE:luk 2:29}} Now loosen the bonds of your servant, O Lord, in peace,
According to your saying;
38 {{BIBLE:luk 2:30}} For my eye has witnessed your mercy,
39 {{BIBLE:luk 2:31}} Which you have made ready because of the whole world;
40 {{BIBLE:luk 2:32}} A light for the unveiling of the nations,
And a glory to your people Israel.
